    "sections": {
        "description": "WoWmart Plus is a modern, versatile, and high-performance WooCommerce child theme designed for contemporary online storefronts, boutique shops, electronics, fashion, beauty, furniture, and multi-category retail businesses. Built on the flexible WoWmart framework, WoWmart Plus features sleek typography, vibrant color styling, customizable header layouts, responsive grid and list blog styles, and seamless WooCommerce integration. Fully responsive and translation-ready, WoWmart Plus offers the ultimate shopping experience across all desktop and mobile devices."
